; Table navigation move: rise to travel height, then X/Y in machine coordinates.
; Travel height is the same one rack_change.ngc uses to cross the rack.
; #1 = machine X, #2 = machine Y, #3 = XY feed in mm/min, #4 = travel height (machine Z)
o<nav_move> sub
M70
G21 G90
G53 G0 Z#4
G53 G1 X#1 Y#2 F#3
M72
o<nav_move> endsub
M2
